{"symbol":"ZAP.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-12T22:41:16Z","info":{"address1":"Al. Tysiaclecia Panstwa Polskiego 13","city":"Pulawy","zip":"24-110","country":"Poland","phone":"48 81 565 2833","fax":"48 81 565 2856","website":"https://www.pulawy.com","industry":"Agricultural Inputs","industryKey":"agricultural-inputs","industryDisp":"Agricultural Inputs","sector":"Basic Materials","sectorKey":"basic-materials","sectorDisp":"Basic Materials","longBusinessSummary":"Zaklady Azotowe Pulawy S.A. manufactures and sells fertilizer and chemical products worldwide. It provides nitrogen fertilizers under PULAN, PULAN MACRO, megAN 33,5, SALMAG, PULMIX, Saletrzak 27N, eNpluSTM, and PULREA name; urea under PULGRAN name; urea ammonium sulfate under the PULGRANS name; RSM, RSMOptima and RSMS, PULSAR and ammonium sulfate from the Flue Gas Desulfurisation Unit; nitrogen fertilizer solution with sulfur under PULASKA name; potassium nitrate, fertilizer-grade calcium nitrate, calcium nitrate with boron, and fertilizergrade liquid urea, and Azoplon. The company also offers chemical products, such as COOLANT, a dry ice; hydrogen peroxide; anhydrous ammonia, compressed hydrogen, liquefied carbon dioxide, and nitric acid that are used in the chemical industry; caprolactam used for industrial production of solid and liquid formulations; melamine for manufacturing a range of synthetic resins; caprolactam for industrial production of solid and liquid formulations; LIKAM, an ammonia water solution that are used in power generation, tanning, agricultural, rubber, dye, organic, glass industries, and pH control agent; NOXy, a urea water solution used in automotive industry; and PULNOx that is used as a reducing agent in vehicle emissions control technologies. In addition, it provides packaging and foil products, including flat open sacks, big bag contribution, colored foils, flat foil belts, FSS foil tape, garbage bags, garden foils, LDPE, and stretch protective films. Further, the company is involved in production of heat, process steam, water, sodium sulfite, and sulfuric acid; cargo handling; lease of property, plant and equipment and other services; sale of plastic bags, plastic film, rubbish bags; sale of merchandise and materials and of services; and providing phosphate fertilizers and fertilizer blends. The company was founded in 1960 and is based in Pulawy, Poland. Zaklady Azotowe Pulawy S.A. operates as a subsidiary of Grupa Azoty S.A.","fullTimeEmployees":3771,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Wojciech  Kozak","title":"Vice President of Management Board","fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":314000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Katarzyna  Stasiak","title":"Vice President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":314000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Piotr  Kruk","title":"Member of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2024,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Tomasz  Ogrodnik","title":"Independent Member of the Supervisory Board & Secretary","fiscalYear":2024,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Marcin  Celejewski","title":"President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2024,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1735603200,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":43.4,"open":43.4,"dayLow":42.9,"dayHigh":43.4,"regularMarketPreviousClose":43.4,"regularMarketOpen":43.4,"regularMarketDayLow":42.9,"regularMarketDayHigh":43.4,"dividendYield":0,"exDividendDate":1658966400,"payoutRatio":0.4342,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":4.15,"beta":0.054,"volume":535,"regularMarketVolume":535,"averageVolume":1056,"averageVolume10days":896,"averageDailyVolume10Day":896,"bid":43.1,"ask":43.3,"marketCap":823856448,"nonDilutedMarketCap":829591000,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":42.1,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":55,"allTimeHigh":276,"allTimeLow":38,"fulldayPrice":43.1,"fulldayChange":-0.300003,"fulldayChan